{"slug":"Universal-Script-Fe-kick-40473","_id":"682d535c148ccc10e2bd8385","title":"Fe kick","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Kick gui\n\nI just felt like it don't ask why I made this even tho there a leave button/:\n\nMy discord server if you want to join idc very much","tags":[],"script":"local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\n-- Create the ScreenGui\nlocal screenGui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\nscreenGui.Name = \"KickUI\"\nscreenGui.ResetOnSpawn = false\nscreenGui.Parent = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\n-- Create the Kick Button\nlocal button = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nbutton.Name = \"KickButton\"\nbutton.Size = UDim2.new(0.25, 0, 0.08, 0)\nbutton.Position = UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 0.9, 0)\nbutton.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5)\nbutton.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(200, 50, 50)\nbutton.TextColor3 = Color3.new(1, 1, 1)\nbutton.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\nbutton.TextSize = 20\nbutton.Text = \"Kick Me\"\nbutton.TextScaled = true\nbutton.Parent = screenGui\n\n-- Round corners\nlocal uiCorner = Instance.new(\"UICorner\")\nuiCorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 12)\nuiCorner.Parent = button\n\n-- Kick logic\nbutton.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n\tplayer:Kick(\"You clicked the kick button!\")\nend)","owner":{"_id":"67f56f809ade65d7bf6d81a7","username":"Slimefrog","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6e6d45ee3af83f359e37866113d55be465e013e6eddb477e8ef9ecf77b93139d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67f56f809ade65d7bf6d81a7-1747843037474.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67f56f809ade65d7bf6d81a7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6e6d45ee3af83f359e37866113d55be465e013e6eddb477e8ef9ecf77b93139d.webp","ori